window.products.push({"id":844058,"name":"Hohm SteamDream Garment Steamer | Portable Handheld Fabric Steamer for Clothes | Powerful 1500W Fast Heat-Up | Perfect for Home and Travel | Includes ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m+XDyPlgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The New Hohm SteamDream - Light, Compact & Powerful Whether you have a business meeting, job interview, or a wedding to attend - the Hohm SteamDream provides a quick way to maintain that fresh, dry-cleaned look, no matter if you are at home or on the go.   Gone or the days where you have to risk ruining your clothes by using a traditional iron. Your Hohm SteamDream will gently remove wrinkles from all kinds of materials no matter how delicate. Key Features Include: - Powerful 1500W Heating Element: For ultra-fast steam generation.  - DrySteam Technology: Continuous flow of steam without wet spots - Auto Shut-Off Function: To prevent unit from overheating  - Removable Translucent Watertank: Allows convenient refilling.  - Light & Portable: Great for home and travel  - 3 Additional Attachments: To accommodate most of your steaming needs Product Specifications: - Water Tank Capacity: 100ml / 3.4oz  - Steaming Time: 5-7 minutes  - Power Cord Lenght: 1.80m/ 6ft - Power Rating: AC 110V, 50/60 Hz - Output: 1500W  - Weight: 0.65kg / 1.4lbs (without accessories) - Dimensions (cm/in): 29 x 14 x 5 / 11.4 x 5.5 x 1.96 Accessories: - Wool Brush Attachment: For removal of threads and hair  - Upholstery Brush: For sterilization and neutralization of odors  - Line Clip Crease Attachment: For adding creases into fronts of trousers  - Travel Pouch: For Storage or Travel Please note: This product is for vertical use only.  Like all Hohm Products, your SteamDream Garment Steamer comes with a LIFETIME EXCHANGE WARRANTY . Click the 'Add to Cart' button now to let the SteamDream bust your wrinkles once and for all!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61m+XDyPlgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HÖHM","source_asin":"B06XYSP57F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844058","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XYSP57F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XYSP57F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":844059,"name":"Paper Towel Holder Under Cabinet,Adhesive&Wall Mount No Drill Paper Towel Rack for Kitchen,Bathroom,etc,Space Aluminum-Firm and Not Easy to Bend(Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AshjUby5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"The paper towel rack pursues a simple, flexible and practical design to make your space stylish and tidy, and provide you with high-quality daily life. Specification Style: modern Body material: aluminum Surface technology: electroplating Size: 13.19*3.07*1.18 inch Net weight: 0.39 pounds (175g) Installation method: No drilling glue Rugged and durable: space aluminum material, super viscous glue Multi-function: store everything and save space Easy installation: MS adhesive sticking without punching Suitable size: many kinds of paper towel rolls Can be assembled without drilling: Step 1: Clean the wall and make sure it is smooth Step 2: Mark the position of the paper towel holder on the wall Step 3: Apply MS adhesive evenly and vertically to the back of the paper towel holder (3-5 cm apart) Step 4: Press the firmly against the wall with both hands and attach the auxiliary sticker. Step 5: After waiting for 24-48 hours(2 days),tear off the auxiliary sticker. If the auxiliary sticker is removed and glued still to the product,please use the auxiliary sticker to repeatedly paste twice to remove the residual MS adhesive on the product. Suitable for installation in: Smooth/concave tile, smooth/convex marble, hard glass surface, smooth/convex metal, mosaic wall Not suitable for installation inl: Plaster, stucco, wallpaper, painted walls Special or uncertain walls can consult us in advance. Tips: A.There are also detailed installation steps on the auxiliary sticker B. You can try to heat the MS adhesive with a hair dryer. When the adhesive becomes soft, you can tear paper towel holder off. Box: Kitchen paper holder*1,MS adhesive and auxiliary stickers*1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AshjUby5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N\\\\C","source_asin":"B09MD58Z88","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844059","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MD58Z88","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MD58Z88","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
