window.products.push({"id":844373,"name":"BLAZANT T-12S Toaster Oven Air Fryer Combo, 20QT Smart Digital Touch Screen Toaster Ovens Countertop, Stainless Steel, Even and Fast Heating, Perfect ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DGXJmpjeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍗【EXCLUSIVE HANGABLE DRUMSTICK ACCESSORY】The 20 QT/quart stainless steel toaster oven air fryer combo is equipped with an exclusive drumstick accessory that allows you to easily grill 12 chicken legs at a time. The drumstick accessory allows the chicken legs to be hung up, ensuring they are cooked evenly and deliciously. 🍗【OVEN WITH AIR FRYER FUNCTION】The BLAZANT T-12 air fryer toaster oven is equipped with a powerful hot air device, which enables it to function as an air fryer. This allows for quick removal of moisture from food surfaces, resulting in crispy textures. The oven is compact, measuring 10.63 x 10.63 x 8.67 inches and can cook a 10\" pizza or 6 slices of toast, making it a practical and space-saving option for most kitchens, countertops, caravans, and RVs. 🍗【SMART LIGHT LANGUAGE & BEEP ELIMINATION】The 20 QT digital smart air fryer oven is equipped with a smart light language that displays the cooking status and progress. Additionally, if the beep noise is a concern, it can be turned off by pressing and holding the \"+\" and \"-\" buttons simultaneously for about 5 seconds. This air fryer oven is designed to be more efficient, saving time and electricity and can be a great alternative to larger capacity built-in ovens. 🍗【SPECIAL FEATURES: TOAST, FLIP REMIND】The T-12 toaster oven air fryer combo has a 20QT capacity and 7 preset cooking functions including Air Fry, Toaster, Bake, Reheat, Keep Warm, Air Broil, and Defrost. It features 16 touch keys for easy and precise control, as well as 6 levels of toast mode, allowing you to choose the degree of toast coloring according to your preferences. Additionally, it has a flip reminder function, which sounds a reminder when food needs to be flipped to avoid scorching. 🍗【59 CUSTOMIZED RECIPES】The BLAZANT air fryer toaster oven countertop comes with 59 customized recipes provided by the BLAZANT personal chef, offering more options for your meals. It also includes 4 practical accessories to meet most of your cooking needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DGXJmpjeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLAZANT","source_asin":"B0C7QN719L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844373","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C7QN719L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C7QN719L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
