window.products.push({"id":844529,"name":"Keetidy C535 115115 Replacement Filter A Compatible with Winix 5500-2 Air Purifier, 5300-2 Air Purifier, WAC5300, WAC5500, WAC6300, 5000, 5000b, 5300,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pDCboPQ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Compatibility --- Compatible with Winix Air Purifier models WAC5300, WAC5500, WAC6300, 5000, 5000b, 5300, 5500, 6300, AM90 & 9000. True HEPA Filter --- The Upgraded 115115 Replacement Filter A can captures 99.97% of dust down to 0.3 microns in size, creating fresh and purified air for you and your family. Activated Carbon Filter --- The C535 Activated Carbon Filter can effectively trap dust, hair, pet fur, lint in the air, and absorb household odors generated by pets, cooking, and smoking. Package Include --- 2 HEPA Filter + 8 Carbon Filters. Tips --- Suggest to Replace the True HEPA filter every 6-8 months and Activated Carbon Filter every 3 months for optimal performance.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pDCboPQ6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KeeTidy","source_asin":"B09GXDZSLF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844529","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GXDZSLF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GXDZSLF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":844530,"name":"Yarns of Cotton Silver Grey Solid Queen Size Sleeper Sofa Bed Sheet Set - Luxury 100% Egyptian Cotton - 600 Thread Count - Fits Mattresses Up to 8\" In","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31mqxNumzBL._AC_.jpg","description":"Surprisingly soft for being so budget-friendly, this Yarns of Cotton Egyptian Cotton sheet set adds a wonderful dose of cozy to any well-made bed. The silky-soft sheet set makes a nice choice for a bedroom, a college dorm room, or for a first-time apartment. It can even be used as a fresh set for overnight guests or as a handy backup set on laundry day. 100% Egyptian Cotton: Made from 100% Egyptian Cotton, the sheet set offers long-lasting strength, natural resistance to shrinking and wrinkles, and a noticeably soft hand feel. In addition to its durability and luxurious suppleness, the microfiber sheet set also offers the best of both insulating warmth and comfortable breathability. Benefits: Egyptian Cotton is distinctive for its unique thinness and strength. These fibers are even thinner than most natural fibers such as silk. Woven tightly, it guarantees extra strength and durability. This fabric has desirable properties such as stain resistance, breathing ability, wrinkle resistance, luxurious appearance, and easy cleaning. Egyptian Cotton products are also the best choices for allergy sufferers. Allergens like dust mites and pollen cannot get in the densely weaved strands. Durable 600-Thread Count: Thread count refers to the number of threads that make up one square inch of fabric. Typically, the finer the threads that can be woven together, the softer the fabric. Thread counts can range from 150 to 1,000. This lower-range thread count is appreciated for its breathability and durability. Machine Washable: For easy care, machine wash the sheet set on warm and tumble dry on low. Use only non-chlorine bleach as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31mqxNumzBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yarns of Cotton","source_asin":"B08W9GDKW7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W9GDKW7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W9GDKW7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":844531,"name":"Marvel Comics: X-Men #1 PX Lunchbox with Thermos","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814bMPp+V3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"From Surreal Entertainment. A PREVIEWS Exclusive! Take your favorite mutants with you on the go with this X-Men illustrated tin tote! Featuring artwork from the 1991 Jim Lee cover of X-Men #1 plus additional interior panels on the sides, this mutant marvel also includes a fully illustrated retro-styled beverage container/soup cup. Don't miss out on adding this lunchbox to your X-Men collection today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814bMPp+V3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Surreal Entertainment","source_asin":"B0B195MLRB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B195MLRB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B195MLRB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
