window.products.push({"id":844584,"name":"Blue Water Bottle Kids Thermos 17 Oz Insulated Water Bottle with Straw Lid and Soft Spout, Leak Proof Water Bottle Thermos for Kids, Stainless Steel V","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714bNgdIqUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Materials: Kids thermos water bottle made of high-quality food-safe grade 316 stainless steel that is 100% BPA free and non toxic. It also a reusable water bottle with fully resistance of oxidation and rust, which is more durable and lasting. Vacuum Insulated Bottle: Double-walled stainless steel water bottle thermos water bottle could keep beverages cold about 24 hours and keep warm about 12 hours. (The warm keeping time depends on the capacity and the temperature of the hot water.) And it has an anti-scald design, the outside temperature of the water bottle surface does not change, it is a safe water bottle for kids using in daily. Ideal Drinking Design: Kids insulated water bottle comes with 2 lid options: Straw lid and soft spout and portable water cup lid to meet your different needs. One spout lid with screw cap allows for fast water flow. Another straw lid allows you to enjoy spill-proof sipping without efforts. The screw-on lid closes tightly to prevent leaks, letting you carry the thermos water bottle in a bag without worry about leaking. Easy to Use: One 500ml / 17 Oz kids stainless steel water bottle and one cute animal pattern bottle carrying bag included in the package, it is a best gift for kids. The portable water bottle can be easily opened with just one hand by pressing the provided button and the silicone straw makes drinking easy and enjoyable. The cute soft antler horn bottle lid and adorable colorful cartoon animal pattern brings luck and happiness to boys and girls. Easy to Clean: Each part of this toddler water bottle can be disassembled to wash, as the drink liquid comes into contact with stainless steel and the silicone straw, but no annoying liquid residue in corners or notches. In addition, the large bottle opening allows good visibility and easy cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714bNgdIqUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nitigo","source_asin":"B09J2D39XS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844584","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J2D39XS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J2D39XS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
