window.products.push({"id":844586,"name":"2 PCS Soap Holder for Shower Wall, Soap Dish Wall Mount with 3M Self Adhesive, Stainless Steel, Rustproof Tray Bar Soap Holder for Bathroom, Tub, Kitc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612zIU0747L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Main Features: 1. Premium SUS304 stainless steel, waterproof, rustproof and durable, bring more health to your family.2. Extra Soap Saver, BPA-free, prolong the life of soap.3. Hollow-out design, drains water quickly, no more mushy soap.4. Two installation methods, self adhesive and wall mounted.5. Multi-purpose, not only for soap hold, but also for cup, toothbrush, bath ball, toilet paper, bath brushes and many other accessories.6. Multi-scene use, the soap holder is great for homes, hotels, hospitals, assisted living facilities, gyms, saunas, spas and showers. Self-adhesive Installation Tips: 1. Clean the surface where the soap tray should be fixed.2. Tear off the protective film on one side of the 3M Self adhesive sticker and stick it on the back of the soap holder.3. After removing the remaining protective film of the 3M sticker, move the soap dish to the position you want to place (this place also needs to be wiped clean, otherwise dust will affect the stickiness of the sticker).4. Place the side with the sticker close to the wall and press it hard for about 30 seconds.5. Use the product 24 hours later after installation. Product Specifications: Material: SUS304 stainless steelColor: Silver or Black MatteSize: 12.3 x 8.3 x 4 cm/4.84 x 3.27 x 1.57 inWeight: 110g/3.88oz Package Included: 2 x Soap Holder (Silver) or 2 x Soap Holder (Black Matte)2 x Soap Saver (White) or 2 x Soap Saver (Black)2 x 3M Self-adhesive sticker2 x Wall-mounted screw set Note: It is recommended that you do not place heavy objects on the soap holder within 24 hours after sticking the soap holder. After 24 hours, the double-sided tape would be very strong and sticky, and has good water resistance, you can boldly use soap dish in the bathroom.If you have any problem with our Soap Dish or Soap Saver, please feel free to reach out to us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612zIU0747L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N\\\\A","source_asin":"B09CFVZVTC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CFVZVTC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CFVZVTC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
