window.products.push({"id":844605,"name":"Raymond Waites Laundry Tote (Pink)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RUn6Rq3YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Covered in stylish floral prints and detailed with sturdy handles, this laundry tote offers an effective and stylish way to conceal, contain, and carry laundry to and from your laundry room or a nearby laundromat. The Printed Tote with Rope Handles by Raymond Waites features a classic rectangular shape and a distinctive design with a colorful allover print, a solid interior lining that matches one color in the print, and durable rope handles woven through metal grommets along the top of the bag. The handles make it easy to carry by hand or toss over the shoulder while the soft sided design allows you to overstuff the bag and cram items inside. With its primary function as a laundry tote, this printed bag can be used as a carryall around the house or used to tote items to and from work or school. The durable cotton fabric has its own natural texture while the casual print adds a touch of classic feminine style to the overall look. The prints range from neutral and pastel floral prints to chic medallion prints to multicolored designs in vibrant color combinations. As a laundry tote, you can easily stuff it full of dirty clothing on your way to the washing machine and fill it neatly with folded clothing after it’s been washed and dried. The sturdy handles make it easier to carry from room to room than a traditional basket and allow you to leave your hands free to carry other essentials. Perfect for use in any bedroom or dorm room, the flat bottom holds the tote bag open and upright while the rope handles can be hung easily over a closet doorknob if floor space is limited. Choose a color that coordinates with your current room decor or opt for a pattern that brings some distinctive style and adds interest to a simplistic room design. If you have to leave the house to attend to your laundry, this bag is so pretty that no one will suspect you’ve got your dirty clothing stuffed inside.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91RUn6Rq3YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Raymond Waites","source_asin":"B00TXQ3O3C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844605","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00TXQ3O3C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00TXQ3O3C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
