window.products.push({"id":844644,"name":"Huray Rayho Carrots Mini Wood Crate Set Easter Tiered Tray Decorations Farm Fresh Carrots Wooden Sign Farmhouse Spring Wooden Basket with Handles East","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713gwpbcvRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GREAT ADDITION FOR EASTER DECOR - This farmhouse mini wooden crate with carrots, grass, and price sign is perfect for your Spring or Easter tiered tray. Add to your mantle, table, countertop, shelf, or desk to welcome guests that come to your home. This mini crate set gives your Easter decor a touch of farmhouse style and will be a great focal piece up front and center on your tray. QUALITY MATERIALS - These farm fresh carrots crate and price tag are made of sturdy wood material and are printed with premium vinyl. The carrot is made of foam and plastic, lightweight, real looking, and durable. PACKAGE INCLUDES - Our Easter Wooden Crate set comes with a mini wooden crate, 6 mini carrots, grass, wood stick, glue dot, and price sign. Each carrot is 2.7 inches. The wooden crate measures 6x3.6x2.7 inches(LxWxH). WIDE RANGE OF USAGE - These cute Easter tiered tray decor is perfect for your tiered tray, dining table, entry table, mantle or anywhere in the house， which can also be applied as a holiday present or housewarming present for your friends. GREAT SERVICE - Purchase with confidence! Every order includes brand-new items that are carefully hand-packaged and sealed in a box. If you are not happy with your order, contact us and we'll make it right!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713gwpbcvRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Huray Rayho","source_asin":"B0BMFHQ24V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMFHQ24V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMFHQ24V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":844645,"name":"Trudeau Graviti Battery-Operated Pepper Mill, Matte Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31c-vgN60UL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Graviti Pepper Mill features a grinding mechanism located at the top of the mill that automatically begins to grind as it is flipped upside down. Gravity sensors initiate and terminate grinding based on the movement and position of the mill. Isaac Newton would have definitely approved of the new Graviti Mill! The Graviti Mill has an easy-to-use tilt motion. No buttons are required to activate this battery-operated mill. Newton wannabes simply have to insert the batteries, flip the mill and let gravity do the rest! Ideal for everyone, the Graviti Mill is effortless and can be used with just one hand. Equipped with a ceramic grinder, the strongest and most durable grinding mechanism on the market, the Graviti Mill will maintain its sharpness and never rust – even when used over a steaming pot. Our ceramic mills first cut then grind to maximize flavour. Trudeau Graviti Mill: no button, no effort, no mess! Amazon.com As its name implies, the Graviti battery-operated pepper mill from Trudeau leans heavily on the laws of physics for its function and appeal. A sleek and amusing gadget that also makes great ground pepper, the piece turns on automatically when flipped upside down. This saves grinding effort, of course, but it is also useful for the stirring cook who only has one free hand to add spice, not to mention that it serves as a fun conversation starter. To ensure that the Graviti is not mere gimmickry, Trudeau equips it with a durable and efficient ceramic grinder, and a finely tunable knob for adjusting coarseness. The grinder works well for both pepper and sea salt and arrives filled with gourmet peppercorns. It washes up by hand, runs on 6 AAA batteries, and stands 7-3/4 inches high. Trudeau makes the mill in several attractive colors and backs it with a five-year warranty. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31c-vgN60UL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trudeau","source_asin":"B000UUC9GS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000UUC9GS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000UUC9GS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
