window.products.push({"id":844743,"name":"jasmineland Ultra Thin Bath Mat Washable Diatomaceous Earth Bathroom Mat Non Slip Small Bath Rug Absorbent Quick Dry, Thin Bathroom Rug Fit Under Door","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P+WSBGt3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Super Absorbent & Fast Drying: This is a soft version of the diatomaceous earth bathroom rug. The bath mat can suck up water within 1 second when you come out from bathtub or shower. Watermarks will disappear within few minutes - 3 times quicker than traditional bath mat! Save your floors from dripping water! Easy to Clean & Vacuum Workable: Because of the smooth non-fiber layer, dirt and hair can’t attach to the surface. Simply wipe or rinse it, and it will still maintain shape and colors. Moreover, the thin design won’t disturb sweeping robot and can be cleaned off easily! Perfect bathroom mat for family with naughty child and pet! New Tech & Eco Friendly: Unlike traditional shaggy bathroom floor mat, you will never be bothered by fiber dropping, fuzzy pilling or smell! As the rug is made of diatomite and technical velvet, and it doesn’t accumulate water nor hide dust. Non Skid & Premium Rubber Backing: 100% high quality rubber backed! It can grip on wet and smooth floor tightly and flatly without curling up, minimize the risk of slipping of kids and elderly. Hurry to say goodbye to traditional slippery TPE/TPR backed bath rugs! Ultra Thin & Perfect Size: Only 0.11 inch thickness! Low profile and fit under door. 17x24 inch or 40x60 cm. Ideal size and fit sink, toilet and bathtub. Wide Use & Durable: It's more than a mat for bathroom. The modern and luxury design can go well with many decor. It can be kitchen rug, laundry room rug, door mat. No fibers and rubber backing makes waterproof. Therefore no shedding, no pilling and water won’t seep underneath the mat, can be a long term use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81P+WSBGt3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"jasmineland","source_asin":"B0BL9R4QRY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL9R4QRY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL9R4QRY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
