window.products.push({"id":844795,"name":"BAMFOX Bamboo Bookshelf,Bookcase and Storage Shelf with 2 Tiers,Ideal for Living Room,Bathroom,Kitchen,Office and More,26\"x13.7\"x19.7\" in Natural/Whit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zdqIMzRdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH QUALITY Made with bamboo Side frame and high-quality MDF panel looks elegant and very durable. Bamboo material is very environmental protection, high density, not easy to wear and deformation. Due to the characteristics of bamboo, its hygroscopicity and dust resistance are higher than that of wood. MULTIPURPOSE The bookshelf has a Industrial style that fits most home and office decors.In addition, this shelf has multiple uses to help organize your daily supplies,like toiletries,towels,sundries,decorative things,shoes,books,plants,and small appliance in bathroom,living room,office, kitchen,etc.It can maximize space, simplify organization,keeping a neat environment. FREE STACKING The hight of the shelf is suit for kids. But each type of shelf can be stacked and the combination is constantly changing.Two 2-tier shelving units can be stacked into a 4-tier shelving unit, three 2-tier shelving units can be stacked into a 6-tier shelving unit,if you have 3-tier shelving unit,2-tier and 3-tier shelving unit can be stacked into a 5-tier shelving unit, Two 3-tier shelving units can be stacked into a 6-tier shelving unit.You can decide the height of the combined shelf by yourself . EASY TO INSTALL We offer all the accessories you need for your open shelf. You only need to assemble this shelf in a few quick steps.The assembly instructions are very easy to follow. It will only take you 3 minutes.Renters can have your own standing storage shelf and take them when moving home. Product specifications: Please keep an eye on your children/pets when near the unit. Brand:BAMFOX Material: Bamboo&MDF Color:White&Nature Size: 22''L x 14.6''W x 4.5''H (56 x37 x 11.5cm)   Weight : 9.7lbs (4.4kg) Package Include: 2 x MDF panel 2 x bamboo Side frame  1 x Tools 1 x installation instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zdqIMzRdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BAMFOX","source_asin":"B07MCVHGYD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MCVHGYD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MCVHGYD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":844796,"name":"Automatic Soap Dispenser Wall Mount, Touchless Automatic Hand Sanitizer Dispenser 700ml Motion Sensor Smart Soap Dispenser for Hospitals, Home, Office","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HNFN0KBLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💧【Touchless & Sensitive】: No longer need to touch the hand sanitizer dispenser, just put your hand under the sensor, the sensitive infrared sensor will automatically sense and dispense some soap to help you and your family stay away from bacteria and maintain a healthy life.(NOTE: When you use dispenser at first time, there was some air in the pump, you need work dispenser several times until liquid soap drop down) 💧【Wall Mounted & Space Saving】: Wall-mounted drilling is easy and stable. The wall-mounted hand sanitizer dispenser can also save space and avoid a large number of bottles occupying the sink. We have prepared two installation solutions for you to choose. One is to drill holes in the wall to fix the screws, and then install the soap dispenser. The other is that we provide you with a strong tape, you can stick it on the wall, and then use the attached screws to install directly without punching. 💧【Energy Efficiency & Easy Refill】: Using 4 AA-size batteries (not included). 700ml capacity-practical container transparent design, and equipped with a key to lock the container to avoid contamination. The transparent window allows you to easily view the internal liquid situation, easy to refill. 💧【Suitable for Different Hand Sanitizers & Widely Used】:This automatic hand sanitizer dispenser was using durable ABS+PC Material, with good impact resistance and corrosion resistance. It can be used with hand soap, dish soap, shower gel or shampoo. You can use the soap dispenser flexibly according to your needs. More places can be used-perfect for airports, hospitals, hotels, restaurants, schools, and bathrooms, kitchens, offices, and other public places. 💧【Non-Drip Design】Our soap dispenser uses smart infrared sensor and will not drip or leak. Therefore, if you are looking for a neat solution to help keep your hands and bathroom clean, you can't miss this dispenser. 30 days return or replacement quality warranty & lifetime technical supports. If you have any questions about installation or products, please feel free to contact us, we will solve it within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HNFN0KBLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MaikcQ","source_asin":"B08CZK9K9T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CZK9K9T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CZK9K9T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
