window.products.push({"id":844798,"name":"Homotte Cute Farmhouse K Cups Holder, Ladder Design with Support Feet for Kcup Coffee Storage and Organize, Black Coffee Pod Holder for Small Space Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FlWnucmYL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Attention: We admit that this product is defective, the legs don’t lock into place. You can place it against the wall for a simple decoration.If you think it doesn't meet your expectations, please contact us and we will do our best to solve your problem. 1. SIMPLE & UNIQUE - Provides a new way for the storage of your k cup coffee: the ladder shape design can be leaned against the wall and can stand upright by virtue of the support feet on both sides. Full of modern feeling, no matter what kind of furniture it goes with, it matches well. 2. SIZE & MATERIAL - LxWxH=12.2 x 9.3 x 0.98 inches, the size that one hand can control. Wood-like MDF material, stain, moisture resistant, water proof, no need to worry about coffee spilled on it will corrode the surface, premium sturdy material will not be affected by wet weather. 3. SPACE SAVING - The coffee cups can be neatly organized by this k-cup holder. You can place specific K cups on each floor according to you and your family's taste. It makes it easy to select different flavors. In addition, it is definitely a lovely kitchen artwork. 4. EASE OF USE - The bottom of the holder is installed with anti-slip bases, suitable for all types of countertops. No assembly required. if the screw is loose, tighten it with a screwdriver. Super easy to clean, you just need to wipe with a damp cloth. 12 Capacity, exquisite display holder. 5. SUITABLE OCCASIONS - You can display them in coffee shops, restaurants, markets, homes, offices, etc., suitable for all indoor premises. In addition, this beautifully packaged k cup pod holder can also be used as a gift for your family and neighbors. This will be the icing on the cake of a housewarming gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FlWnucmYL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homotte","source_asin":"B0BJVHQTNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844798","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJVHQTNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJVHQTNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
