window.products.push({"id":844883,"name":"ELEMUSE Lightweight White Down Comforter Queen - Cooling All Season Duvet Insert with Corner Tabs - 100% Egyptian Cotton Down Proof Cover - Medium War","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nJrXJ5XjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Goose Down Fill & All Season Duvet Insert - Filled with high-quality white goose down, 400 yarns per square inch, super soft, breathable and excellent feeling. The medium warmth makes the white down comforter suits for all seasons, provides you with a comfortable and sweet night sleep. Luxurious Softness & No leakage- 400 thread count per square inch Egyptian Cotton fabric. Super soft, plush, fluffy and silk touch provide you a cozy and silent night. The baffle box design is adopted to make the white down is evenly filled. The 4 corner tongues help to hold the duvet insert cover in place. No need to worry about the filling shifting or escaping through the pinhole, never be agglomeration or spots, no feather sting to poke skin. Healthy & Odorless- 100% healthy, we choose down material carefully and responsibly, after washing many times to keep them fresh, without any unpleasant odor, fluffy, it's quality with the highest purity. The health is approved by OCS, RDS and OEKO-TEX which ensure your healthy sleep. Let us enjoy a 5-star hotel-style sleeping. Super Lightweight & Easy Care: ELEMUSE king size down comforter measures 106x90 inches with a fill weight of 55oz. This all-season duvet insert has a moderate weight and can provide suitable warmth for most people in all climate,no matter summer, autumn, spring or winter night. 3 sizes (twin, queen/full, king) are available, suitable for any bed type. It can be washed in a washing machine with cold water and a gentle cycle, and it can keep in a brand new state after machine washing. Gift Bag & Good Service- Equipped with duvet bag used for storage to keep the bed cover fluffy. Cotton bags can also be used as gift packaging. It is a perfect choice to give this duvet to relatives and friends. 100% satisfaction guaranteed, please feel free to ask our customer service team for help, and all satisfactory information will be provided immediately when needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nJrXJ5XjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELEMUSE","source_asin":"B08JYB8F8F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JYB8F8F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JYB8F8F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
