window.products.push({"id":844892,"name":"Living Stone Bakeware Set of 6 pieces","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TodkC2zdL._AC_.jpg","description":"Living Stone Bakeware is naturally non-stick, easy to clean, evenly bakes, scratch resistant, durable, and stacks for easy storage.Living Stone Bakeware is non-stick, making baked goods easy to remove in one piece! Baked cakes are usually the hardest thing to get out of bakeware, but cakes come out of Living Stone Bakeware without sticking or breaking!The natural non-stick Living Stone coating also makes clean-up easy. No more scrubbing for hours trying to remove caked on food. And no soaking burned on food. Kiss those rubber gloves, gallons of soap and wasted time goodbye.Food is cooked evenly throughout because of the heavy gauge .800 millimeter steel. You see, cheap thin aluminum bakeware heats up quickly burning parts of your baked goods while leaving other parts not fully cooked. The thick steel that Living Stone Bakeware is made from ensures nice even heating throughout your baked goods.The Living Stone non-stick coating will also help prevent food from burning, further making your baked goods turn out perfect every time.Metal utensils will not scratch the surface of the Living Stone Bakeware. No scratches, nicks, or chips were found in the Living Stone coating after using metal utensils.The heavy gauge .800 millimeter steel construction also makes Living Stone Bakeware very durable and will last you years and years. Its thickness also resists warping which is common with cheap, thin bakeware.And the complete Living Stone Bakeware set stacks for easy storage in your kitchen cabinets and doesn’t take up much room. This leaves your kitchen cabinets neat and organized.Living Stone Bakeware also has built-in silicone handles for a non-slip grip when you are taking your hot bakeware out of the oven. The sure grip also prevents spilling of batter filled bakeware when you are placing it into the oven.Living Stone Bakeware contains NO PTFE/PFOA or other dangerous chemicals in its non-stick","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TodkC2zdL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EdenPURE","source_asin":"B082TW2SGX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844892","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082TW2SGX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082TW2SGX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
