window.products.push({"id":844897,"name":"M-A 8 Pack Sublimation Blanks Straight Skinny Tumbler, Comes with Silent Silicone Coaster and Operation Guide for Sublimation Lovers (20 oz White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711DaoHj5pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How to sublimate your tumbler? 1.Select the desired picture and print it out 2.Wrap the pattern paper on the bottle with heat-resistant tape 3.Then put a shrink film on the outside, blow the shrink film tightly with heat gun 4.Put it in the oven, adjust the temperature to 338 degrees Fahrenheit /170 degrees Celsius wait for about 5 minutes to complete If you choose a heat press to sublimate your tumbler, the recommended time about 50 seconds and the temperature about 338 degrees Fahrenheit. If you choose an oven to sublimate your tumbler, the recommended time about 5 minutes and the temperature about 338 degrees Fahrenheit. Note: Note: Note: 1. Please try to choose fast-drying sublimation paper. If not, please wait one hour after the pattern is printed before sublimation, otherwise it will affect the sublimation effect. 2. The sublimation paper has rough and smooth front and back, please be sure to print the pattern on the smooth surface. 3. Please use high temperature resistant shrink film The low-temperature shrink film cannot withstand long-term high-temperature baking, and the shrink film may melt and fail to complete sublimation. 4. After the sublimation, please wait for 5 minutes or put on gloves and take out the cup to avoid hot hands. 5. After the sublimation, do not use blades or any sharp tools to disassemble, to avoid leaving scratches on the outer wall of the cup. You can refer to the attached operating instructions to complete your personalized gift cup. If you encounter any problems during the operation, please stop the operation immediately and contact us via email. We have a professional technical team that can help you solve various problems in the operation process. We recommend that you try with a blank sublimation tumbler first to avoid unnecessary losses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711DaoHj5pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"M-A","source_asin":"B09B1RY89M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-844897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B1RY89M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B1RY89M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
